begin="01:14.248" end="01:14.727">들</span> <span begin="01:14.839" end="01:15.180">다</span> <span begin="01:15.180" end="01:15.485">떠</span><span begin="01:15.485" end="01:16.134">나</span><span begin="01:16.134" end="01:16.746">도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使林林总总的朋友们全都离你而去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">geu man deon qin gu deul da ddeo na do</span></p><p begin="01:17.373" end="01:19.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:17.373" end="01:17.664">여</span><span begin="01:17.664" end="01:17.983">기</span> <span begin="01:17.983" end="01:18.558">난</span> <span begin="01:18.652" end="01:18.974">네</span> <span begin="01:18.974" end="01:19.298">옆</span><span begin="01:19.298" end="01:19.778">에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我也会站在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yeo gi nan ne yeo pe</span></p><p begin="01:19.887" end="01:23.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:19.887" end="01:20.224">계</span><span begin="01:20.224" end="01:20.555">속</span> <span begin="01:20.555" end="01:21.180">서</span> <span begin="01:21.180" end="01:21.502">있</span><span begin="01:21.502" end="01:21.821">을</span><span begin="01:21.821" end="01:22.434">거</span><span begin="01:22.434" end="01:23.159">야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一直陪伴在你身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gye sok seo i sseul geo ya</span></p><p begin="01:23.370" end="01:24.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:23.370" end="01:24.038">Baby</span> <span begin="01:24.038" end="01:24.344">don't</span> <span begin="01:24.344" end="01:24.678">cry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">宝贝 不要哭泣</span></p><p begin="01:24.678" end="01:25.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:24.678" end="01:25.264">Baby</span> <span begin="01:25.264" end="01:25.544">don't</span> <span begin="01:25.544" end="01:25.916">cry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">宝贝 不要哭泣</span></p><p begin="01:25.916" end="01: