m:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">宝贝 不要哭泣</span></p><p begin="01:38.544" end="01:40.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:38.544" end="01:38.876">한</span> <span begin="01:38.876" end="01:39.190">번</span><span begin="01:39.190" end="01:39.504">만</span> <span begin="01:39.504" end="01:39.835">더</span> <span begin="01:39.835" end="01:40.110">날</span> <span begin="01:40.110" end="01:40.421">위</span><span begin="01:40.421" end="01:40.731">해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">请再一次为我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">han beon man deo nal wi hae</span></p><p begin="01:40.731" end="01:44.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:40.731" end="01:41.069">Just</span> <span begin="01:41.069" end="01:41.391">give</span> <span begin="01:41.391" end="01:41.786">me</span> <span begin="01:41.786" end="01:42.123">your</span> <span begin="01:42.123" end="01:44.695">smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只要给我你的微笑</span></p><p begin="01:44.867" end="01:49.542" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:44.867" end="01:45.462">이</span><span begin="01:45.462" end="01:46.128">미</span> <span begin="01:46.128" end="01:46.432">모</span><span begin="01:46.432" end="01:46.772">든</span> <span begin="01:46.772" end="01:47.083">일</span><span begin="01:47.083" end="01:47.326">은</span> <span begin="01:47.326" end="01:47.683">지</span><span begin="01:47.683" end="01:48.015">나</span><span begin="01:48.015" end="01:48.286">갔</span><span begin="01:48.286" end="01:48.932">잖</span><span begin="01:48.932" end="01:49.542">아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所有事已成云烟的瞬间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i mi mo deun i reun ji na gan za na</span></p><p begin="01:50.519" end="01:55.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:50.519" end="01:50.854">그</span><span begin="01:50.854" end="01:51.153">래</span> <span begin="01:51.153" end="01:51.806">그</span><span begin="01:51.806" end="01:52.177">래</span> <span begin="01: